WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
Here's how to play the Golden Girls drinking game

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.400
You will need

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.590
Up to 3 other friends

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.970
Your favorite alcoholic beverages

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.370
and an episode of the best Bea Arthur based sitcom of all time

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:12.240
No, not Maude. Come on.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.280
First everyone chooses a character

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.490
Next, agree on a mode of play.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.020
There are 2 possible modes

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.550
Zing or Get Zinged

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.950
When playing Zing, you drink every time your character zings someone. 

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.990
I treat my body like a temple

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.050
Yeah, open to everyone. Day or night! *Cash register bell sound*

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.130
When playing Get Zinged, you drink every time your character gets zinged.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.000
I treat my body like a temple

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.400
Yeah, open to everyone. Day or night! *Cash register bell sound*

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.480
You can tell who the alcoholics are because they choose Sophia when playing Zing

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.520
Or Rose when playing Get Zinged.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.730
Watch the episode and drink with every zing

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.960
taking shots based on your character and these special circumstances

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.170
Whenever Sophia says, "Picture it"

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.060
Picture it! Sicily, 1922.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.590
Whenever Dorothy gives advice

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.330
You should have a home field advantage, why don't you invite him over here.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.540
Whenever Blanche mentions Big Daddy

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.940
I haven't had to disappoint so many men since Daddy tore down the treehouse.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.830
Or whenever Rose says a strange word from St. Olaf.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.080
As they say in St. Olaf, "Helderbargenblargenflur"

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.610
Then there's the Cheesecake Rule

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:18.710
If your character sits at the table eating cheesecake, you have to finish your drink and start another.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.450
And finally, everyone must sing the theme song during the credits.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:28.060
*Singing* Your heart is true, your a pal and a confidante

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:31.120
Please drink responsibly and thank you for being a friend.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:41.490
*drunken singing of the Gold Girls theme song*

